            "value": "Der Countdown auf dem Sperrbildschirm kann ab 8 Stunden vor dem Iftar starten."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le compte à rebours sur l’écran verrouillé peut démarrer 8 heures avant l’iftar."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De aftelling op het toegangsscherm kan vanaf 8 uur voor de iftar beginnen."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kilit ekranı sayacı iftardan 8 saat öncesinden itibaren başlatılabilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Qibla is the direction of the Kaaba in Mecca, calculated from your location along the shortest route over the globe and measured from true north.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "القبلة هي اتجاه الكعبة في مكة المكرمة، وتُحسب من موقعك عبر أقصر طريق على سطح الأرض وتُقاس من الشمال الجغرافي."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Qibla ist die Richtung zur Kaaba in Mekka, berechnet von deinem Standort entlang des kürzesten Wegs über die Erde und gemessen von geografisch Nord."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La qibla est la direction de la Kaaba à La Mecque, calculée depuis votre position selon le chemin le plus court sur le globe et mesurée depuis le nord géographique."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De qibla is de richting van de Kaaba in Mekka, berekend vanaf je locatie langs de kortste route over de aarde en gemeten vanaf het ware noorden."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kıble, Mekke'deki Kâbe'nin yönüdür; konumunuzdan yeryüzündeki en kısa yol boyunca hesaplanır ve coğrafi kuzeyden ölçülür."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Qur'an is shown in the Amiri Quran font by the Amiri Project, under the SIL Open Font License.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يُعرض القرآن بخط Amiri Quran من مشروع أميري، بموجب رخصة SIL Open Font License."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Koran wird in der Schrift Amiri Quran des Amiri Project angezeigt, unter der SIL Open Font License."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Coran est affiché avec la police Amiri Quran de l’Amiri Project, sous la licence SIL Open Font License."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De Koran wordt getoond in het lettertype Amiri Quran van het Amiri Project, onder de SIL Open Font License."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kur'an, Amiri Projesi'nin Amiri Quran yazı tipiyle, SIL Open Font License kapsamında gösterilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Qur'an text is the Uthmani text of the Tanzil Project, used unchanged under its terms (Creative Commons Attribution 3.0).": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "نص القرآن هو النص العثماني لمشروع تنزيل، ويُستخدم دون تغيير وفق شروطه (المشاع الإبداعي، نسب المصنف 3.0)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Korantext ist der Uthmani-Text des Tanzil Project, unverändert nach dessen Bedingungen verwendet (Creative Commons Namensnennung 3.0)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte du Coran est le texte uthmani du Tanzil Project, utilisé sans modification selon ses conditions (Creative Commons Attribution 3.0)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De Korantekst is de Uthmani-tekst van het Tanzil Project, ongewijzigd gebruikt volgens de voorwaarden ervan (Creative Commons Naamsvermelding 3.0)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kur'an metni, Tanzil Projesi'nin Osmanî metnidir ve şartlarına uygun olarak değiştirilmeden kullanılır (Creative Commons Atıf 3.0)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app follows the language of your iPhone, unless you choose another one here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتبع التطبيق لغة iPhone، ما لم تختر لغة أخرى هنا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App nutzt die Sprache deines iPhone, außer du wählst hier eine andere."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’app utilise la langue de votre iPhone, sauf si vous en choisissez une autre ici."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De app volgt de taal van je iPhone, tenzij je hier een andere kiest."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burada başka bir dil seçmezseniz uygulama iPhone'unuzun dilini kullanır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The countdown is on your Lock Screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العدّ التنازلي على شاشة القفل"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Countdown ist auf deinem Sperrbildschirm"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le compte à rebours est sur l’écran verrouillé"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De aftelling staat op je toegangsscherm"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sayaç kilit ekranınızda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next prayer and a countdown on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island. iOS keeps it for up to 8 hours; opening the app brings it back and moves it on to the next prayer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الصلاة القادمة مع عدّ تنازلي على شاشة القفل وفي Dynamic Island. يُبقيها iOS حتى ٨ ساعات؛ وعند فتح التطبيق تعود وتنتقل إلى الصلاة التالية."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das nächste Gebet und ein Countdown auf dem Sperrbildschirm und in der Dynamic Island. iOS zeigt das bis zu 8 Stunden; öffnest du die App, kommt es zurück und springt zum nächsten Gebet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prochaine prière et un compte à rebours sur l’écran verrouillé et dans la Dynamic Island. iOS l’affiche jusqu’à 8 heures ; ouvrir l’app le fait revenir et passer à la prière suivante."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het volgende gebed en een aftelling op het toegangsscherm en in het Dynamic Island. iOS bewaart dit tot 8 uur; als je de app opent, komt het terug en gaat het door naar het volgende gebed."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sıradaki vakit ve geri sayım, kilit ekranında ve Dynamic Island'da. iOS bunu en fazla 8 saat gösterir; uygulamayı açınca geri gelir ve sıradaki vakte geçer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next prayer is %@, at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الصلاة القادمة %@، عند %@."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das nächste Gebet ist %@, um %@."
